        {
          "text": "Okokuqala kwezithelo zenu zonke zokuqala, lokweminikelo yenu yonke yenhlobo zonke kuzakuba ngokwabaprist; linike futhi abapristi okokuqala kwempuphu yenu egayekileyo, ukuze isibusiso sehlele endlini yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
